  "id": "curried-chickpea-sandwich-filling",
  "name": "Curried Chickpea Sandwich Filling",
  "subtitle": "A tangy, lightly spiced chickpea spread with raisins and chutney",
  "description": "Combine chickpeas with a curry-seasoned chutney dressing, raisins, and red onion, then serve in bread or rolls with lettuce.",
